Reading: a press on the header without movement changes nothing; a move of −150 px moves frame, name, notepad and photo by exactly −150 px while note A/B, the table and the checklist stay; the release announces "Zone moved."; the photo pulled out (clamped at the canvas bottom) and dragged back docks into its slot at the new place; a click on the name starts renaming; a cancel after −90 px restores the frame; a drag far beyond the surface stops at the surface edge; at 390×844 there is no overflow and the move works the same.

Screenshots: `P0-34-moving.png`, `P0-34-moved.png` (1440×900), `P0-34-mobile.png` (390×844). They were taken before the hint and legend text gained the zone-move sentence.
